    <div>
      <div>
        <button type="button" class="side-overlay__close" data-close-overlay aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        <div class="privacy-policy-overlay__content">
          <h3 id="privacy-policy-overlay-title">Privacy Policy &amp; Terms of Use</h3>
          <div class="privacy-policy-overlay__body">
            <p class="privacy-policy-overlay__updated">Last updated: 01 July 2025</p>

            <h4 class="privacy-policy-overlay__heading">Terms of Use for Realevate Website</h4>
            <p>This document sets out the terms of use for the website of Realevate agency (hereinafter: &ldquo;Realevate&rdquo; or &ldquo;the marketer&rdquo;), which is operated and managed by it. Browsing and using the website are subject to the conditions set out below and constitute the user&rsquo;s acknowledgment and agreement to all of their provisions. A user who does not agree to these terms, in whole or in part, is required to refrain from further use of the website.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">1. Definitions</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> &ldquo;User&rdquo; &ndash; any person or entity browsing the website, whether or not registered for services.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> &ldquo;Properties&rdquo; &ndash; real estate assets located in various countries around the world and the information about them, which is displayed on the website.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> &ldquo;Website Services&rdquo; &ndash; all information, display, referral, or contact services provided through the website.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">2. Nature of the Service</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> The website presents general information about real estate offered for sale or investment in various countries around the world, including images, descriptions, technical data, and prices.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Realevate operates as a global real estate marketing agency and client advisory service for the purchase of properties in Cyprus, Montenegro, and Georgia. Realevate maintains working relationships with a number of local developers and presents their projects on this website and through other channels.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> Realevate provides accompaniment throughout the purchase process, including consulting, guidance, explanations regarding projects, physical accompaniment by a representative for property tours, and assistance with bureaucratic processes involving developers, banks, and local authorities &ndash; until completion of the purchase transaction.</p>
            <p><strong>d.</strong> Any real estate purchase transaction, if it takes place, is a direct transaction between the user and the property owner or their representatives only. Realevate is not a party to that transaction, does not act as seller, buyer, or provider of legal or contractual services in relation to it, and shall not bear any liability in connection with it.</p>
            <p><strong>e.</strong> The user declares that they do not rely on any representation, commitment, information, or promise &ndash; oral or written &ndash; given to them, to the extent given, by Realevate, and that they carry out all the due diligence and decisions independently and at their own responsibility.</p>
            <p><strong>f.</strong> Any future engagement between the user and those parties, if it occurs, shall be conducted directly between the parties, without direct involvement or commitment on the part of Realevate.</p>
            <p><strong>g.</strong> The publication of properties on the website does not constitute a binding offer or any legal commitment on the part of Realevate.</p>
            <p><strong>h.</strong> All expenses involved in participating in property tours arranged by Realevate &ndash; including flights, accommodation, transport, insurance, and meals &ndash; shall be borne by the client, unless otherwise stated in advance in writing. Realevate reserves the right to reimburse the client for part or all of those expenses, at its sole discretion and without obligation.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">3. Legal Clarification</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> Realevate is not a brokerage agency and is not subject to the Real Estate Brokers Law. Accordingly, it should not be regarded as a broker, and no obligations or rights attributed to a broker should be inferred from its conduct.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Nevertheless, Realevate operates in good faith, fairly, reliably, and professionally for the benefit of its clients.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">4. Investment Risk Statement</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> Investment in real estate &ndash; and especially in foreign countries &ndash; involves material risks, including economic, planning, regulatory, operational, and tax risks.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Any advice provided by Realevate is based on information supplied to it by third parties, which may be incomplete or outdated.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> The website does not constitute legal, economic, tax, or investment advice and is not a substitute for independent professional advice.</p>
            <p><strong>d.</strong> The user is required to consult qualified advisors before making any decisions relating to investments, contracts, or commitments.</p>
            <p><strong>e.</strong> Realevate shall not be liable for any outcome, loss, or damage &ndash; direct or indirect &ndash; arising from reliance on information on the website or from decisions made following use of the website.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">5. Limitation of Liability</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> Information on the website is provided to Realevate by third parties. Realevate is not responsible for its accuracy, completeness, or timeliness.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Information may change and may be updated from time to time at the discretion of property owners or their representatives &ndash; without prior notice.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> Realevate is not a party to agreements entered into between the user and other parties and is not a guarantor of their terms or performance.</p>
            <p><strong>d.</strong> Realevate is not responsible for the conduct or obligations of the developers and has no control over the progress of the projects, the issuance of permits, or the fulfillment of any contractual obligations between the parties.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">6. Consideration for the Service</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> Realevate receives consideration for its services from developers only. It does not charge the client directly, nor does it collect commission or brokerage fees from clients.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Working relationships exist between Realevate and developers only, without prejudice to its commitment to quality service for the client.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> Realevate&rsquo;s services do not create agency, fiduciary, or contractual liability toward the user, except as expressly stated in this document.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">7. Use of Images and Visual Content</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> All images, renderings, and visual content appearing on the website are for illustration purposes only.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> There may be differences between renderings and the actual condition of a property. No visual content should be regarded as a commitment by Realevate or an accurate description of the property.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> Copyright in images and visual content belongs to their lawful owners, and Realevate holds a license to use them for publication on the website only.</p>
            <p><strong>d.</strong> Visual content from the website may not be copied, reproduced, distributed, or used in any way without prior written permission.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">8. Intellectual Property</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> All intellectual property rights in the website &ndash; including design, text, source code, structure, graphics, and logos &ndash; belong to Realevate or parties that have granted it a license to use them.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> No commercial use, copying, distribution, or translation of website content may be made without prior written permission from Realevate.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">9. Privacy and Information Security</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> Realevate may collect statistical and anonymous information in the course of use of the website, for operation, maintenance, and improvement of the service.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Realevate undertakes to protect user privacy in accordance with applicable law and will not transfer personal information to third parties without consent, except where required by law.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> When you submit a contact form, we use the details you provide to respond to your inquiry and, if you opt in, to send updates and opportunities related to our services. You may withdraw marketing consent at any time by contacting us at info@realevate.agency.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">10. General Provisions</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> These terms of use apply equally to all genders.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> The law applicable to these terms is Israeli law only. Exclusive jurisdiction is vested in the competent court in Tel Aviv.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> Realevate reserves the right to update these terms of use at any time. Updated terms take effect upon publication on the website.</p>

            <h5 class="privacy-policy-overlay__subheading">11. Accessibility</h5>
            <p><strong>a.</strong> Realevate is committed to making this website accessible and usable for as many people as reasonably possible. We strive to follow widely accepted accessibility principles and continuously improve the browsing experience for all users.</p>
            <p><strong>b.</strong> Accessibility is considered throughout the design, development, and maintenance of the website. While we make ongoing efforts to improve accessibility, certain features or third-party content may have limitations beyond our direct control.</p>
            <p><strong>c.</strong> If you experience any accessibility issue or require assistance accessing any part of this website, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@realevate.agency">info@realevate.agency</a> or +972-54-602-0690, and we will make reasonable efforts to assist you as promptly as possible.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
